msgid "Makes this Wayland desktop reachable from RealVNC Viewer on your phone or another computer. It listens on this computer only until you turn on Local Network Access."
msgstr "Wayland mahaigain hau zure telefonoko edo beste ordenagailu bateko RealVNC Viewer-etik eskuragarri egiten du. Ordenagailu honetan bakarrik entzuten du, Sare lokaleko sarbidea aktibatu arte."

